      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "lock_collateral · seize — guards (both on chain, per listing)\n① slot − price.posted_slot ≤ listing.max_price_age            (keeper alive)\n② now − price.publish_time ≤ listing.max_publish_age_secs   (quote fresh — NEW)\nsolvency:  E_Δ = k_c·E_c − k_l·E_ℓ ,   k_c ← price_scaled(price, expo) × multiplier ,   k_l ← haircut\n→ Pyth data doing work: no fresh price ⇒ no lock, no seizure",
      "originalText": "lock_collateral · seize — guards (both on chain, per listing)\n① slot − price.posted_slot ≤ listing.max_price_age            (keeper alive)\n② now − price.publish_time ≤ listing.max_publish_age_secs   (quote fresh — NEW)\nsolvency:  E_Δ = k_c·E_c − k_l·E_ℓ ,   k_c ← price_scaled(price, expo) × multiplier ,   k_l ← haircut\n→ Pyth data doing work: no fresh price ⇒ no lock, no seizure",
